ttps://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-06T04:47:11Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T08:18:46Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123242","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123242","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123242.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123242.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Summary\n\nThis draft carries the tvOS platform/export work from #118332 plus the additional compatibility fixes we needed to ship and validate a real Godot game on iOS/iPadOS/tvOS.\n\nThe branch adds and updates:\n\n- tvOS platform/export support based on #118332\n- tvOS static library/export-template generation\n- tvOS Compatibility renderer support using OpenGL ES 3\n- runtime fallback from Metal to Compatibility on Apple TV hardware that does not support Godot's Metal renderer requirements\n- tvOS display scale handling so the rendered viewport is not cropped to the lower-left portion of the screen\n- Siri Remote input bridging: swipes map to arrow keys, Select maps to Enter, Menu maps to Escape, Play/Pause maps to Space\n- tvOS export renderer option: Compatibility by default, Metal selectable for newer hardware\n- tvOS-specific `UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities` generation so iPhone/iPad-only A12 flags are not emitted into tvOS archives\n- GLES3 startup/runtime guards used by the tvOS compatibility path\n\n## Validation\n\nValidated against the library/configuration used to ship Trivall on the App Store.\n\nLocal build verification:\n\n```sh\n/Users/mikael/dev/fracta-new/engines/.godot-build-venv/bin/scons platform=tvos target=template_release arch=arm64 vulkan=no metal=yes opengl3=yes -j8\n```\n\nResult: builds `bin/libgodot.tvos.template_release.arm64.a` successfully.\n\n## Relationship to #118332\n\n#118332 is the original upstream draft for tvOS platform support. This branch is a companion/update branch that includes that work plus release-proven compatibility fixes. It is still a draft because the upstream tvOS base work is currently behind `master` and will need conflict resolution before it is review-ready.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123242/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123242/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}